{"ticker":"VZ","updated":"2026-10-24T00:26:49Z","profile":{"longName":"Verizon Communications Inc.","shortName":"Verizon Communications Inc.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Telecom Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.verizon.com","fullTimeEmployees":97600,"marketCap":185552257024,"trailingPE":11.630209,"forwardPE":8.471345,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.3359175,"pegRatio":0.81,"targetMeanPrice":51.24091,"targetHighPrice":62.0,"targetLowPrice":45.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.007,"earningsGrowth":-0.22,"grossMargins":0.59453,"operatingMargins":0.22999,"profitMargins":0.11643,"totalRevenue":138894999552,"beta":0.248,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":51.68,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":38.54,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":6.26},"summary":"Verizon Communications Inc., through its subsidiaries, engages in the provision of communications, technology, information, and streaming products and services to consumers, businesses, and governmental entities worldwide. It operates in two segments, Verizon Consumer Group (Consumer) and Verizon Business Group (Business). The Consumer segment provides wireless services across the wireless networks in the United States under the Verizon and TracFone brands and through wholesale and other arrangements; and fixed wireless access (FWA) broadband through its wireless networks, as well as related equipment and devices, such as smartphones, tablets, smartwatches, and other wireless-enabled connected devices. The segment also offers wireline services in the Mid-Atlantic and Northeastern United States, as well as Washington D.C. through its fiber-optic network, Verizon Fios product portfolio, and a copper-based network. The Business segment provides wireless and wireline communications services and products, including FWA and wireline broadband, advanced communication services, corporate networking, security and managed network, local and long-distance voice, and network access services to deliver various IoT services and products to businesses, government customers, and wireless and wireline carriers in the United States and internationally. The company distributes its products and se","summary_zh":"Verizon Communications Inc. 透過其子公司，致力於向全球消費者、企業和政府實體提供通訊、技術、資訊以及串流產品和服務。它分為兩個部門：Verizon Consumer Group（消費者）和 Verizon Business Group（商業）。消費者部門以 Verizon 和 TracFone 品牌並透過批發和其他安排在美國的無線網路上提供無線服務；透過其無線網路以及相關設備和設備（例如智慧型手機、平板電腦、智慧手錶和其他支援無線功能的連接設備）提供固定無線存取（FWA）寬頻。該部門還透過其光纖網路、Verizon Fios 產品組合和銅線網路在大西洋中部和美國東北部以及華盛頓特區提供有線服務。該業務部門提供無線和有線通訊服務和產品，包括FWA和有線寬頻、高級通訊服務、企業網路、安全和託管網路、本地和長途語音以及網路存取服務，為美國和國際上的企業、政府客戶以及無線和有線營運商提供各種物聯網服務和產品。該公司經銷其產品和服務","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"電信服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":44.44,"h":44.48,"l":43.96,"c":44.23,"v":16021200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":44.11,"h":44.42,"l":43.75,"c":43.96,"v":17328200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":44.02,"h":44.28,"l":43.88,"c":44.27,"v":12046600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":44.1,"h":44.19,"l":43.69,"c":43.93,"v":15842800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":43.97,"h":44.29,"l":43.93,"c":44.23,"v":14792700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":44.16,"h":44.48,"l":43.51,"c":43.8,"v":21123700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":43.5,"h":43.74,"l":42.88,"c":43.74,"v":21828500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":44.07,"h":44.42,"l":43.93,"c":44.18,"v":14480500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":44.1,"h":44.47,"l":44.02,"c":44.38,"v":13406700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":42.98,"h":43.62,"l":42.94,"c":43.32,"v":30273900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":43.36,"h":43.74,"l":43.35,"c":43.57,"v":15595500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":43.49,"h":43.67,"l":43.01,"c":43.49,"v":14807800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":43.61,"h":44.15,"l":43.51,"c":44.14,"v":15510600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":44.01,"h":44.09,"l":43.77,"c":43.97,"v":13723500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":44.05,"h":44.25,"l":43.77,"c":43.87,"v":15034700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":43.87,"h":43.95,"l":43.3,"c":43.74,"v":16173600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":43.87,"h":44.41,"l":43.86,"c":44.21,"v":14414000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":43.88,"h":43.9